1
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:09,583
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,783 --> 00:00:12,030
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:17,920
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,240
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:28,640
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,669 --> 00:00:30,437
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:35,280
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:39,660
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,490 --> 00:00:44,320
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:48,780
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:53,060
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:58,180
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:02,200
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,530 --> 00:01:08,770
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,230 --> 00:01:15,600
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,637 --> 00:01:18,520
=Episode 4=

17
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,239
Explain yourself.

18
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:22,719
What's going on?

19
00:01:23,239 --> 00:01:23,719
Boss Lin.

20
00:01:24,359 --> 00:01:25,840
My dad is sick and needs money.

21
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:28,200
So I borrowed some from Nanhu Gang.

22
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:38,200
B-Boss Lin...

23
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:41,879
Huogun can't be the m-mole.

24
00:01:42,359 --> 00:01:43,719
When did I say

25
00:01:43,719 --> 00:01:45,319
he was the m-mole?

26
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:48,560
Boss Lin was just wondering,

27
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:49,799
(May Fortune Come)
if Huogun needed money,

28
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:50,680
(May All Go Well)
why didn't he come to him?

29
00:01:50,959 --> 00:01:51,799
Why borrow from outsiders?

30
00:01:54,357 --> 00:01:54,983
(Dongcheng White Horse)

31
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,439
Get up.

32
00:01:59,040 --> 00:01:59,680
Get lost.

33
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,879
Pay off what you owe them first.

34
00:02:09,120 --> 00:02:09,639
Boss Lin.

35
00:02:10,159 --> 00:02:11,199
This is from Boss Hui.

36
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,439
You're a grown man. Quit fussing.

37
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,879
Just take it.

38
00:02:19,199 --> 00:02:20,879
Say thank you.

39
00:02:21,319 --> 00:02:22,439
Th-Thank you, Boss Lin.

40
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,479
W-Why make things so tense?

41
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,360
Come on.

42
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:30,319
Come here.

43
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:33,599
(Dongcheng White Horse)

44
00:02:33,599 --> 00:02:34,560
I heard

45
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,919
some of the elders' headquarters

46
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:38,599
have been hit.

47
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,224
Whoever knows so many

48
00:02:40,225 --> 00:02:40,840
of our shipping routes

49
00:02:41,319 --> 00:02:43,400
and hit several headquarters at once

50
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:45,599
is no ordinary mole.

51
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:46,800
That mole

52
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:48,840
may have been working for Nanhu Gang

53
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:50,879
for quite some time.

54
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,360
If that's true,

55
00:02:52,639 --> 00:02:54,479
they may know what happened to Boss Hai.

56
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,159
But plenty of people know our routes.

57
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,439
(Dongcheng White Horse)
That's way too broad.

58
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,800
Before Boss Hai died,

59
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:02,680
I checked every place he'd been.

60
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,000
I found nothing.

61
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,479
There's always a way around a problem.

62
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:08,840
(Dongcheng White Horse)

63
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,960
Relax.

64
00:03:11,199 --> 00:03:11,960
There's always...

65
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:15,560
a way around a problem.

66
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,520
You picked that one up too?

67
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:22,520
Boss Che.

68
00:03:22,719 --> 00:03:24,199
I found this a few days ago.

69
00:03:24,919 --> 00:03:26,080
The photo shop owner said

70
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,280
it was dropped off three days ago,

71
00:03:28,039 --> 00:03:29,599
the day Boss Hai was killed.

72
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,560
It's...

73
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:33,240
(Dec. 13, 1999, 14:30, 14:22)
near that fish farm.

74
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:37,465
This car

75
00:03:37,466 --> 00:03:39,319
showed up after Boss Hai arrived.

76
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,639
It vanished when he left.

77
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:43,840
This Mercedes S-Class has no plates.

78
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:45,919
Know why Hutou Jun

79
00:03:45,919 --> 00:03:47,080
got that nickname?

80
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:50,639
(Dongcheng White Horse)
He specializes in smuggling S-Classes.

81
00:03:51,159 --> 00:03:52,439
This S-Class has no plates.

82
00:03:52,919 --> 00:03:54,120
He probably smuggled it.

83
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,199
So that means

84
00:03:56,159 --> 00:03:57,439
if we find this car,

85
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,697
we can pick up

86
00:03:59,698 --> 00:04:00,759
the trail again.

87
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:01,840
Exactly.

88
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:03,800
Always so dramatic.

89
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:06,319
Look into it.

90
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,520
Got it, Boss Lin.

91
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,439
Go.

92
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:09,560
Go.

93
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:15,800
Boss Lin.

94
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,319
Boss Che.

95
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:18,959
Found it.

96
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:21,319
(VIN Record)
This color and model

97
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:21,959
only came in two batches.

98
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:23,240
I checked both.

99
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,319
(Lien on Title)
What's going on here?

100
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,920
Only this one was used as collateral.

101
00:04:27,639 --> 00:04:28,959
Where's the car now?

102
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:29,839
I don't know.

103
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:31,759
You don't know?

104
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,656
Cars used as collateral

105
00:04:34,657 --> 00:04:35,600
usually change hands several times.

106
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,399
They usually end up with gangsters.

107
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:38,600
How would you even trace it?

108
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:39,439
Right.

109
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:40,319
Right.

110
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:41,519
Right.

111
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:42,319
Fine. You're right.

112
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:45,240
You know where the owner is staying?

113
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,000
Yeah.

114
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:46,720
Where?

115
00:04:47,079 --> 00:04:47,600
Tell me.

116
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:47,959
Where?

117
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:48,680
At a hotel.

118
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:49,920
Then what are you doing here?

119
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:50,759
Let's go.

120
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:55,240
I haven't finished eating.

121
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:55,560
He's paying.

122
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:56,120
You got it.

123
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,639
Seen it?

124
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,000
Sir, you've got the wrong guy.

125
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:11,279
I haven't had that car in ages.

126
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,360
Where did it go?

127
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,879
I lost money gambling.

128
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,399
I put it up as collateral
at Yongle Casino.

129
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,839
Yongle Casino.

130
00:05:28,439 --> 00:05:29,399
Hutou Jun's place.

131
00:05:30,199 --> 00:05:31,839
If Hutou Jun destroyed the car,

132
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:33,199
then we lose the evidence.

133
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,160
I bet he couldn't bear to.

134
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:36,319
It's a nice car.

135
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:39,120
Fix it up, repaint it, good as new.

136
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,000
You said it yourself.

137
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:43,600
Every job leaves a trail.

138
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:49,480
Only two repair shops are on his turf.

139
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:51,439
Let's check them.

140
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:06,639
Be careful.

141
00:06:07,959 --> 00:06:08,560
Relax.

142
00:06:29,519 --> 00:06:30,000
Boss Che.

143
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:33,759
Could Hutou Jun have destroyed it?

144
00:06:35,959 --> 00:06:36,759
Look at this one.

145
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:46,079
No overspray around the headlights.

146
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:50,680
The paint is really smooth.

147
00:06:52,439 --> 00:06:52,959
Boss Che.

148
00:06:54,319 --> 00:06:54,720
Look here.

149
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,360
With factory paint,

150
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,639
the body lines are usually sharper.

151
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:01,800
With a repaint like this,

152
00:07:02,079 --> 00:07:03,160
if it's not done well,

153
00:07:03,439 --> 00:07:04,800
the edges get rounded off.

154
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:07,680
Watch this.

155
00:07:09,879 --> 00:07:10,360
Wait.

156
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:13,000
Hutou Jun changed the badge and paint.

157
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,360
That means he's covering his tracks.

158
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:16,759
Leave a mark and you'll tip him off.

159
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,600
Easy.

160
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:25,360
You taught me all this.

161
00:07:27,326 --> 00:07:27,852
Here.

162
00:07:28,439 --> 00:07:29,199
Hold the light for me.

163
00:07:31,439 --> 00:07:33,399
I never taught you to pick car locks.

164
00:07:34,759 --> 00:07:36,639
Enough. Give me a hand.

165
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:57,000
The VIN matches.

166
00:07:58,399 --> 00:08:00,560
This is the car from the fish farm.

167
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,560
Looks like Hutou Jun

168
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,160
couldn't bring himself to destroy it.

169
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,040
But he probably won't use it again.

170
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:10,480
One of his guys probably does.

171
00:08:12,399 --> 00:08:13,720
If we can prove

172
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,759
one of Hutou Jun's guys uses this car,

173
00:08:17,079 --> 00:08:18,319
that would tie him

174
00:08:18,759 --> 00:08:19,959
to Boss Hai's death.

175
00:08:21,639 --> 00:08:22,399
I'll check over there.

176
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:41,360
Find anything?

177
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,759
The floor mats are brand-new.

178
00:08:44,399 --> 00:08:45,600
Looks like they cleaned it out.

179
00:08:46,039 --> 00:08:46,519
Keep looking.

180
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:47,759
Don't miss anything.

181
00:08:53,120 --> 00:08:54,120
Another lighter.

182
00:08:57,810 --> 00:08:58,423
Whoa.

183
00:09:02,519 --> 00:09:03,080
Look.

184
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,600
How's this for a detail?

185
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:07,200
Yours?

186
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,480
What's wrong with you?

187
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,639
Keep this clue.

188
00:09:14,541 --> 00:09:17,472
(Auto Repair)

189
00:09:38,879 --> 00:09:39,720
I'll take the one with bleached hair.

190
00:09:40,039 --> 00:09:40,799
You take the rest.

191
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,399
I hate guys who dye their hair.

192
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,440
Are Hutou Jun's guys

193
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,559
all underage or what?

194
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,200
Fine. They're all yours.

195
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:51,919
You first.

196
00:10:04,830 --> 00:10:06,483
♪I rule the streets♪

197
00:10:06,510 --> 00:10:08,560
♪A lone wolf under neon lights♪

198
00:10:08,637 --> 00:10:10,150
♪Half my face caught in the light♪

199
00:10:10,210 --> 00:10:12,400
♪The other half lost in the fight♪

200
00:10:12,530 --> 00:10:13,823
♪Loyalty is more than words♪

201
00:10:13,863 --> 00:10:15,880
♪It's the weight on my shoulders♪

202
00:10:15,917 --> 00:10:17,200
♪Honed in the darkness♪

203
00:10:17,230 --> 00:10:19,137
♪An edge that never dulls♪

204
00:10:19,203 --> 00:10:20,423
♪I hold my turf in the palm of my hand♪

205
00:10:20,450 --> 00:10:22,417
♪Our code is ground into the dirt♪

206
00:10:22,756 --> 00:10:23,943
♪All this glamour is a lie♪

207
00:10:24,017 --> 00:10:26,044
♪Only blood can tell what's real♪

208
00:10:26,510 --> 00:10:27,669
♪I stand alone at the top♪

209
00:10:27,715 --> 00:10:29,760
♪Cold eyes fixed on the city lights♪

210
00:10:29,915 --> 00:10:33,930
♪My brothers always watch my back♪

211
00:10:34,297 --> 00:10:35,950
♪I rule the streets♪

212
00:10:35,992 --> 00:10:37,992
♪A lone wolf under neon lights♪

213
00:10:38,034 --> 00:10:39,547
♪Half my face caught in the light♪

214
00:10:39,607 --> 00:10:41,797
♪The other half lost in the fight♪

215
00:10:41,927 --> 00:10:43,220
♪Loyalty is more than words♪

216
00:10:43,260 --> 00:10:45,277
♪It's the weight on my shoulders♪

217
00:10:45,314 --> 00:10:46,597
♪Honed in the darkness♪

218
00:10:46,627 --> 00:10:48,534
♪An edge that never dulls♪

219
00:11:16,519 --> 00:11:17,480
What are you, a bloodhound?

220
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:18,960
No.

221
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:20,200
Looks familiar.

222
00:11:21,039 --> 00:11:21,519
Familiar how?

223
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:24,360
Isn't this a stripper's?

224
00:11:24,559 --> 00:11:27,080
Y-You know a lot about this stuff.

225
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:29,360
Never knew that, Huogun.

226
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:31,679
No. A friend goes there all the time.

227
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:32,519
You don't have friends.

228
00:11:36,639 --> 00:11:38,200
Find out which club this is from.

229
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,159
Start with this one.

230
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:42,000
I found it in the car.

231
00:11:42,960 --> 00:11:44,440
(Nightclub)
This club's on Hutou Jun's turf.

232
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,200
So finding it there makes sense.

233
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,879
But we don't know if it's related.

234
00:11:49,559 --> 00:11:50,240
Got it, Boss Che.

235
00:11:50,399 --> 00:11:51,039
Leave it to us.

236
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,039
Let's go.

237
00:11:57,159 --> 00:11:57,879
Take this.

238
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,320
I am

239
00:12:06,799 --> 00:12:07,840
hungry.

240
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:08,960
Okay.

241
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,440
I'll get you some food.

242
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:12,840
Come on.

243
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:17,000
Egg tarts.

244
00:12:22,199 --> 00:12:25,979
(Dongcheng White Horse)

245
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:26,960
Fu's asleep.

246
00:12:28,519 --> 00:12:29,600
No, he's not.

247
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:31,240
Like he'd fall asleep.

248
00:12:40,639 --> 00:12:42,240
Sleeping kids raise their hand.

249
00:12:45,039 --> 00:12:46,600
And keep it raised.

250
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,440
What a shame.

251
00:12:51,919 --> 00:12:52,879
Let's have roast goose.

252
00:12:53,879 --> 00:12:54,799
But Fu's asleep.

253
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,639
Guess we'll eat it ourselves.

254
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,519
And egg tarts.

255
00:12:59,679 --> 00:13:00,879
Egg tarts!

256
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,919
If you two came back any later,

257
00:13:06,919 --> 00:13:09,120
I would've starved to death.

258
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:11,799
Here, Fu.

259
00:13:15,879 --> 00:13:17,039
Egg tarts.

260
00:13:21,399 --> 00:13:23,519
One each.

261
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,360
You're giving me your favorite egg tart?

262
00:13:28,639 --> 00:13:29,159
Thanks.

263
00:13:38,559 --> 00:13:39,759
Starting now,

264
00:13:40,120 --> 00:13:42,759
everything from your academy days
will be erased.

265
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,440
Lin Che will cease to exist.

266
00:13:45,159 --> 00:13:47,159
Only Ling Che of Dongcheng Gang remains.

267
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,919
Do you know what that means?

268
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:52,120
I'll lose my badge

269
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,159
and all police protection.

270
00:13:53,159 --> 00:13:54,039
It also means

271
00:13:54,519 --> 00:13:55,720
you'll have no friends.

272
00:13:56,559 --> 00:13:58,360
You can never contact your family again.

273
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:00,320
Yes.

274
00:14:00,455 --> 00:14:04,035
♪All I can do is watch you in silence♪

275
00:14:04,435 --> 00:14:08,462
♪I can't read what's in your eyes♪

276
00:14:08,519 --> 00:14:10,080
How'd you get food everywhere?

277
00:14:11,243 --> 00:14:13,243
♪How much farther can we go, brother♪

278
00:14:13,377 --> 00:14:17,360
♪Turning back is never easy♪

279
00:14:18,163 --> 00:14:20,420
♪I stand where day meets night♪

280
00:14:20,680 --> 00:14:26,347
♪Left, right, straight ahead♪

281
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:27,440
Lin.

282
00:14:30,039 --> 00:14:31,240
If you'd never met me,

283
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:33,639
what would you do?

284
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:36,559
I don't know.

285
00:14:38,159 --> 00:14:38,879
Still stealing, maybe.

286
